Package: riattrition
Title: Randomization Inference with Sample Attrition
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Peizan", "Sheng", , "peizan@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Constructs valid p-values and confidence intervals for testing 
    sharp null hypotheses in randomized experiments with missing outcomes. 
    The package accommodates a range of missing mechanisms, including general, 
    monotone positive, monotone negative, sharp, and missing-at-random mechanisms.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
